        "description": {
            "value": "<p><em>Pisces &mdash; 4th (Ultimate) Technique, gained at level 16.</em></p><p><em>Aphrodite's last technique. He calls it a funeral because he has already decided how it ends.</em></p><p>A single black rose crosses the distance. The target must attempt a Fortitude save.</p><p><strong>Success</strong> Half damage and enfeebled 1.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> @Damage[16d6[poison]] damage, enfeebled 2, and <strong>drained 2</strong> &mdash; the rose is drinking.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The rose reaches the heart and <strong>the target dies</strong>. It turns red with what it has taken.</p><hr /><p><strong>Special</strong> From the rose's colour you know the target's <strong>exact current Hit Points</strong>, from the moment you cast until the end of the encounter.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightening (+2 levels)</strong> The damage increases by 2d6.</p><p>On a day your constellation is <strong>Ascendant</strong> this Technique heightens as though you were 4 levels higher; on a <strong>Zenith</strong>, 8 levels higher.</p>"
